 Returns `204 No Content` on success.
 
+## Board Publication
+
+Publishing a board makes it readable by anyone who has its secret URL (`/public/boards/:key`). Drafted cards are never visible on a public board. Only admins can publish or unpublish a board.
+
+### `POST /:account_slug/boards/:board_id/publication`
+
+Publishes the board and generates its secret key (which is kept if the board is published again later).
+
+__Response:__
+
+Returns `201 Created` with the published board:
+
+```json
+{
+  "id": "03f5v9zkft4hj9qq0lsn9ohcm",
+  "name": "Fizzy",
+  "all_access": false,
+  "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:36:35.534Z",
+  "auto_postpone_period_in_days": 30,
+  "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/boards/03f5v9zkft4hj9qq0lsn9ohcm",
+  "public_url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/public/boards/hjwPqzbXfRcY4TnKdmsE",
+  "creator": {
+    "id": "03f5v9zjw7pz8717a4no1h8a7",
+    "name": "David Heinemeier Hansson",
+    "role": "owner",
+    "active": true,
+    "email_address": "david@example.com",
+    "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:36:35.401Z",
+    "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/users/03f5v9zjw7pz8717a4no1h8a7"
+  }
+}
+```
+
+### `DELETE /:account_slug/boards/:board_id/publication`
+
+Unpublishes the board. Its secret URL stops working, but the key is kept so that publishing the board again restores the same URL.
+
+__Response:__
+
+Returns `200 OK` with the unpublished board (`public_url` is `null` again).
+
+## Public Boards
+
+Published boards, their columns and their published cards can be read without an account at:
+
+| URL | Description |
+|-----|-------------|
+| `/public/boards/:key` | The published board with all of its columns |
+| `/public/boards/:key/columns/:column_id` | A single column of the published board |
+| `/public/boards/:key/cards/:number` | A single published card of the published board |
+
+These URLs are also available as JSON documents (`?format=json`).
+
 ## Board Accesses
 
 Board accesses let you see who has access to a board and their involvement level (watching or access only). Any board member can view this information.
diff --git a/test/controllers/boards/publications_controller_test.rb b/test/controllers/boards/publications_controller_test.rb
